Error [E0324]: a type alias needs type parameters — write `alias Name<T> = …`
  --> tests/ui/type_alias_no_params.jet:1:7
    |
  1 | alias Meters = Float
    |       ^^^^^^
 Why: transparent `alias` is only for shortening generic spellings (D-TYPEALIAS1)
 Fix: for a distinct type name over a primitive, use `struct Name(BaseType)` instead
